      "html": "<div class=\"ds-card\"><div class=\"ds-card-title\">知识库</div><p class=\"ds-card-body\">上传文档后自动解析、分块并写入检索索引，回答句末带引用标注。</p></div>",
      "css": ".ds-card{max-width:360px;padding:20px 24px;background:var(--app-container,#FFFFFF);border:1px solid var(--app-hairline,rgba(29,29,31,0.09));border-radius:18px;color:var(--app-text,#1D1D1F);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC','Segoe UI','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif}.ds-card-title{font-size:17px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 12px}.ds-card-body{margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--app-text-secondary,#6E6E73)}@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){.ds-card{background:#1C1C1E;border-color:rgba(235,235,245,0.14);color:#F5F5F7}.ds-card-body{color:rgba(235,235,245,0.60)}}"
